# 0l_sand_hall: GunTurret bases u047a/u0428, tops u047d/u042c. Scan both parts, force the base FSM states and the top's
# PowerDown/PowerUp, hurt and kill the top, then leave so the leash runs out (Withdraw).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/gunturret.py <out> 42b935e4,0l_sand_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f320 scan u047d 15 300
@f330 scan u047a 15 300
@f600 fsm u047a IntoPan
@f700 fsm u047a PanLeft
@f800 fsm u047a PanRight
@f900 fsm u047a AttackExit
@f1000 fsm u047a Flinch
@f1100 fsm u047a CloseDoor
@f1200 fsm u047a OpenDoor
@f1300 fsm u047a Withdraw
@f1400 fsm u047d PowerDown
@f1500 fsm u047d PowerUp
@f1550 fsm u047a Attack
@f1600 damage u047d 5
@f1700 damage u047d 5 missile
@f1800 fsm u0428 Patrol
@f1900 statecall u0428 IntoPan 0
@f1902 statecall u0428 IntoPan 1 0.016
@f1904 statecall u0428 IntoPan 2
@f1910 statecall u0428 AttackExit 0
@f1912 statecall u0428 AttackExit 1 0.016
@f1914 statecall u0428 AttackExit 2
@f1920 statecall u0428 Withdraw 0
@f1922 statecall u0428 Withdraw 1 0.016
@f1924 statecall u0428 Withdraw 2
@f2000 kill u047d
@f2200 obj u047a; obj u047d
@f2300 tp 466 -10 31
@f2900 obj u047a; obj u0428
@f3000 kill u042c
@f3300 objs GunTurret
